he oh-so-painful demise of your previous conceptions (and all of the resist=
ance comprehension of that pain necessarily entails). That=E2=80=99s part a=
nd parcel of the process so famously described as assimilation and accommod=
ation by the great developmental psychologist <a href=3D"https://web.archiv=
e.org/web/20220207131555/https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Piaget" target=
